  "details": "When playing VRChat using Virtual Desktop and SteamVR on a Quest 2 using a  link cable to a PC the left thumbstick will randomly start to jitter back and forth in the direction that I am pressing the thumbstick. The left thumbstick will also sometimes just lock in one direction, thus not allowing me to open my menu to change the controls. This does not always change when i restart VRChat and will stop and start at random. This exclusively happens in vrchat. not a single other game does this. I replaced my Quest 2 with a new one and the problem still persists.",
